## Era stories (facts to keep)

**design** — Started **2013** as graphic designer; **web from 2015**. **SENAI** + **I'm root** in **2014**. **2018** boom: Vale Telecom job + LM Salgados high demand; WordPress factory (30+ sites; Folha do Comércio, Metasita, Lagoa Silvana, ACDN, Nina Cordeiro, Damasceno, Via Prime; ≥8 for Vale group companies). **VIP Produções** = **2018**, own client — not Vale. **block** classified thread begins **2013**. **ENGRENHA+** = **2025** institutional craft (also chip under platform milestone). **Jardim da Victória** built **2019**, used **2026**. **Victória’s PhotoShoot** = **2026**.

**hardware** — **2019** = Magic Globe year at Faculdade Única (prototype → final machine → Dec defense). SENAI networks was **2014** (design arc), not this band. EN "Magic Globe" / PT "Globo Mágico"; Live `https://isaque.it/cubo/`. Metaphor: find structure under noise.

**ideyou** — **2020** second boom: MioDelivery expands, Saint Germain, Integra Foods, Spa Água Santa, Lucas Bitencourt Records. **barcode.it** and **IdeYouPrint** (print.it predecessor) start **2020**. Pandemic origin with friend **Tainan** (Warface 2013): closed WhatsApp quality group → informal multi-service team. Transitioned brand to **isaque.it**. Meu Aurélio (2023) → prefer **teaching** in catalog.

**teaching** — CS teaching while building school relationships. **Meu Aurélio** (2023). **CTI** + **Victória’s PhotoShoot** in **2026**. Coordinator of Technical Computing at Escola João Paulo II **since Feb 2026**.

**platform** — Convergence under isaque.it: sistema, api, cliente, notify.it, barcode.it, **scan.it**, print.it. Same care as early craft sites, at platform scale. **ENGRENHA+** (2025).

